  "label": "Ironic Self-Deprecation",
  "description": "The meme uses irony to express frustration. The phrase 'there must be some way this victimizes me' is not meant to be taken literally but rather as a humorous exaggeration. It reflects a common internet trope where people mock their own over-the-top emotional reactions to minor inconveniences, often to elicit empathy or shared experience from others. This requires understanding of internet humor conventions.",
